  "local_policies": [
    "Vanessa uses the last committed opponent physical hand play before her original Combo root, including countered committed cards and across turns. Ordinary minion intrinsic played material or frozen non-minion played face is copied base, never current transformed source or effect CAST/summon. No opponent hand inspection.",
    "Korvas matches original accepted keyword attachments of a completed own physical card play. Having Outcast is independent of whether that play activated its left/right Outcast bonus. Ordinary return uses the existing board-to-hand lifecycle and removes temporary buffs.",
    "ETC uses actual completed declared minion combat of the original friendly combat player. A current exact original physical residence supplies current keywords; its unique exact frozen natural-death record supplies death keywords if it died. Never borrow later reentry or printed keywords; unavailable original material explicitly errors. Existing declaration/substitution/interruption and source-alive policies remain.",
    "Liadrin checks the actual own summon event, current living friendly board target and current source/target Attack at body execution, strict lower comparison. Existing captured-keyword grants bind both Divine Shield and Rush to the same original physical residence; no new entry executor.",
    "Zavas accepts the actual native successful own hand discard material, buffs that retained physical body+2/+2 and returns it through the existing discard-return writer. Current earned stored buffs and cost remain; repeated new hand acquisitions repeat growth. Overflow, departure, reveal, rollback and information boundaries use existing policies."
  ],
